          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobut anyun Jeu Baal eng’ Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agos ma istoegei Jeu kasubetab tengekwogikab Jeroboam weritab Nebat, ne kiigochi Israel koyai tengekto, che ki moekab tahabu che kimi Bet-el ak che kimi Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jehovah Jeu, Amu kiiyai ne mie eng’ yaetab imanda ne mie eng’ tainnyu, ak iyachi gotab Ahab ko u tuguk tugul che kimi muguleldanyu, tebe anyun weriguk ng’echeretab laitornatet ne bo Israel, agoi ibindab ang’wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ma mage kiy Jeu kowendote ng’atutikab Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab Israel, eng’ muguleldanyi tugul: ma istoegei tengekwogikab Jeroboam, che kiibeete Israel si koyai tengekto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
